@anon.9bf146a73cb71d9c7e3fe69f46c42f4a.566 = private unnamed_addr constant <{ [628 x i8] }> <{ [628 x i8] c"A mathematical equation.\0A\0ACan be displayed inline with text or as a separate block.\0A\0A# Example\0A```example\0A#set text(font: \22New Computer Modern\22)\0A\0ALet $a$, $b$, and $c$ be the side\0Alengths of right-angled triangle.\0AThen, we know that:\0A$ a^2 + b^2 = c^2 $\0A\0AProve by induction:\0A$ sum_(k=1)^n k = (n(n+1)) / 2 $\0A```\0A\0A# Syntax\0AThis function also has dedicated syntax: Write mathematical markup within\0Adollar signs to create an equation. Starting and ending the equation with at\0Aleast one space lifts it into a separate block that is centered\0Ahorizontally. For more details about math syntax, see the\0A[main math page]($category/math)." }>, align 1
